{'symbol': 'F', 'date': '2023-05-26 07:00:00', 'title': 'JIM FARLEY TO DISCUSS FORD LEADING SHIFT TO DIGITAL VEHICLES AT 39TH-ANNUAL ALLIANCE BERNSTEIN STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE', 'text': 'DEARBORN, MICH.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FORD PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER JIM FARLEY WILL DISCUSS THE FORD+ PLAN FOR GROWTH AND VALUE CREATION LEVERAGING SOFTWARE AND DEEP CUSTOMER UNDERSTANDING IN A NEW ERA OF CONNECTED, ELECTRIC VEHICLES AT THE ALLIANCE BERNSTEIN 39TH ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, MAY 31, 2023, AT 9:00 A.M. ET. IN A FIRESIDE CHAT WITH TECHNOLOGY ANALYST TONI SACCONAGHI, FARLEY WILL DESCRIBE HOW FORD IS SHAPING THE FUTURE OF THE AUTOMOTIVE INDUSTRY BY.'}